## PMI Ticket collector library (taf.ul.sbts.pmi_ticket_collector)  

It gives possibility to gather CPUE and CPRT PMI Records from gNB.  
It reads gNB config from TestLine and creates necessary connections.  

There are plenty of checkers and verifiers to ease the testing.  
Check [documentation](https://taf-ul-sbts-pmi-ticket-collector.docs.taf.ute.nsn-rdnet.net/en/latest/index.html) for more information.  

### Installation

```
pip install -i https://artifactory-espoo2.int.net.nokia.com/artifactory/api/pypi/ute-pypi-virtual/simple taf.ul.sbts.pmi_ticket_collector
```
